# Ship app updates

When a user-facing change in this repo is done (especially `index.html` / `sw.js` version bumps for the PWA at app.specreport.org):

1. Commit the relevant files with a concise message.
2. Push to `origin` on the current branch immediately.
3. Do not wait for a second "please push" — Nicholas wants fix-and-push as one step.

Do not commit unrelated untracked files (icons, `jds-genesis-thread/`, secrets).
Do not force-push. Do not skip hooks.
